~ start
Wend WovenWay: The InkDrinkers came from the Void and consumed all the ink.
Wend WovenWay: Collect the button powerup, then repel the ink they spray into the jar!
=> END

~ interact
if not GameState.player.has_ability(repel_powerup.ability):
	Wend WovenWay: Collect the button powerup, StoryWeaver!
else if fill_game_logic.barrels_completed < fill_game_logic.barrels_to_win:
	Wend WovenWay: Repel the ink into the barrel!
else:
	Wend WovenWay: Well done, StoryWeaver. Let's go north towards Fray's End.
=> END
